{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2021/05/singer-cabinets-mandeville-hero.webp" alt="White shaker cabinets with a farmhouse sink and brick-look backsplash" width="1600" height="1068" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h1>Kitchen Cabinets from Brands You Trust — New Orleans &amp; the Northshore</h1><div class="el-text">The right cabinets can transform more than how your kitchen looks — they change how it works. Better storage, smarter layouts, more functionality out of every inch. Singer Kitchens has been helping Greater New Orleans homeowners make that happen since 1928.</div><div class="el-text">Whether you're planning a full kitchen renovation with one of our designers or you need to buy cabinets for a project you're handling yourself, we have the right cabinet solution for you. Visit one of our two professional showroom design centers — two locations stocked with cabinets you can see, touch, and feel before you decide.</div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Let&#x27;s Talk Kitchens</a></p></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2024/10/10b.webp" alt="Open plan kitchen with a long island and large windows" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Two Types of Cabinetry. All the Choices You Need.</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Singer carries two types of high quality, all-wood cabinetry — Semi-Custom and Stock. Both are available for any project type and any budget. The difference is in the range of selection, customization options, and lead time. Come in and we'll help you find the right fit.</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>SEMI-CUSTOM CABINETS</h2><ul class="icon-list"><li>Large selection of sizes, finishes &amp; door styles</li><li>Modification options available</li><li>Some brands offer custom colors</li><li>Professional 3D Design Rendering Included</li><li>Brands: Diamond Distinction, Diamond Vibe, Decora, Fabuwood, Kitchen Craft</li></ul></div><div class="el-col"><h2>STOCK CABINETS</h2><ul class="icon-list"><li>High quality, all-wood construction</li><li>On-trend styles and sizes</li><li>Available in multiple finishes</li><li>North Point &amp; Mantra available for quick-ship delivery</li><li>Brands: Aristokraft, Mantra, North Point</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2024/10/10b.webp" alt="Open plan kitchen with a long island and large windows" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><h2>Semi-Custom Cabinets — More Selection, More Flexibility</h2><div class="el-text">Our semi-custom cabinet lines give you the widest range of options — sizes, finishes, door styles, wood types, and modification options that let you dial in exactly what you want. Some brands also offer custom color programs, opening up even more possibilities for a kitchen that feels genuinely yours.</div><div class="el-text">Every cabinet we sell in this category meets Singer's standards for construction quality, material durability, and finish consistency. These aren't decisions you have to make alone — our designers have seen every combination of home, style, and budget Greater New Orleans has to offer, and they'll help you land in the right place.</div><div class="el-text"><p><strong>Brands:</strong> Diamond Distinction, Diamond Vibe, Decora, Fabuwood, Kitchen Craft</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Schedule a Design Conversation</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>Stock Cabinets — High Quality, Ready When You Are</h2><div class="el-text">Our stock cabinet lines offer high quality, all-wood construction in a curated selection of sizes, finishes, and door styles. They don't offer the same range of modifications as our semi-custom lines — but what they deliver is consistent quality at an accessible price point, with lead times that are hard to beat.</div><div class="el-text">North Point and Mantra are our quick-ship lines — in-stock and available for delivery in approximately two weeks. Buying cabinets to install yourself? Having your builder or contractor handle it? That's completely fine. We'll help you select the right cabinets in the showroom, get your order placed, and make sure you have everything you need. No full renovation required.</div><div class="el-text">Aristokraft rounds out our stock offering — a well-established line with a solid range of styles and finishes at a price point that works across a wide variety of projects.</div><div class="el-text"><p><strong>Brands:</strong> Aristokraft, Mantra, North Point (North Point &amp; Mantra: quick-ship, ~2 week delivery)</p></div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2024/10/10b.webp" alt="Open plan kitchen with a long island and large windows" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 33fr 33fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2025/07/09mls.webp" alt="Undermount sink in a white quartz countertop" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><h2>Kitchen Updates</h2><div class="el-text">Swap out dated cabinets without committing to a full renovation.</div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2024/11/05mls.webp" alt="Grey kitchen with a gold chandelier and an island cooktop" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><h2>Laundry Rooms &amp; Pantries</h2><div class="el-text">Functional cabinetry for spaces that just need to work.</div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2025/03/05mls-1.webp" alt="White kitchen with a terracotta tile backsplash" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><h2>Bathroom Vanities</h2><div class="el-text">The right cabinet base for a vanity refresh, fast.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 33fr 33fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2026/04/02.webp" alt="White kitchen with a wood ceiling and long marble island" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><h2>Rental Properties</h2><div class="el-text">Quality that holds up at a price point that makes sense for investment properties.</div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2025/09/03mls.webp" alt="White kitchen with wood lower cabinets and a mosaic backsplash" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><h2>Contractor &amp; Builder Projects</h2><div class="el-text">Buy what you need, handle the install your way. We make the ordering easy.</div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2021/05/050721a.webp" alt="Kitchen with grey cabinets and a white island" width="800" height="534" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure><h2>Islands &amp; Add-Ons</h2><div class="el-text">Adding an island or extending existing cabinetry without a full redo.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/showrooms/">See Our Stock Lines In Person</a></p></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Nothing Beats Seeing Cabinet Quality In Person.</h2><div class="el-text"><p>You can look at cabinet photos all day — and we have plenty of them. But the real decision happens when you can touch the construction, open the drawers, and see how the finish holds up under real light. That's what our showrooms are for. Both semi-custom and stock lines are on display. Come in, bring your measurements if you have them, and let's figure out what's right.</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>New Orleans</h2><div class="el-text">Mon–Fri: 10AM–5PM  |  Sat: 10AM–3PM (by appointment)</div></div><div class="el-col"><h2>Northshore — Mandeville</h2><div class="el-text">Mon–Fri: 10AM–5PM  |  Sat: 10AM–3PM (by appointment)</div></div></div></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Let&#x27;s Talk Kitchens</a></p></div><div class="el-col"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+15045394605">Schedule a Design Conversation</a></p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Our Kitchen Cabinet Brands</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Browse the many kitchen cabinet brands we carry below and get a feel for their high quality and craftsmanship.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2023/07/Fabuwood-Logo.webp" alt="Fabuwood cabinetry logo" width="1200" height="291" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Fabuwood specializes in creating kitchens that evoke a feeling of home. Offering a seamless balance of functionality, endurance and poise, Fabuwood cabinets are built to withstand the test of time.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2023/09/Diamond_Log.webp" alt="Diamond cabinetry logo" width="200" height="43" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>The Diamond approach is simple: Don't just think different. Think smarter. Think inside the box. It's all about finding creative ways to get more out of every kitchen or bathroom cabinet. More space. More accessibility.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/diamond-vibe-logo.webp" alt="Cabinetry by Diamond Vibe logo" width="200" height="67" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Diamond Vibe cabinetry is designed to fit into your unique remodeling plans. Choose from the freshest finishes and door styles, along with organizational solutions that put everyday essentials within easy reach.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/aristokraft_2-color.webp" alt="Aristokraft Cabinetry logo" width="250" height="57" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Aristokraft has been creating quality cabinets with an eye on affordability since 1954. Aristokraft products feature state-of-the-art finishes, easy-clean interiors and dependable hardware - all with great style in mind. </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/decora_cb_black.webp" alt="Cabinetry by Decorá logo" width="218" height="84" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Take personalization to the limit with the semi-custom choices available in the Decora cabinet line. Decora's custom paint program offers the option of over 2000 Sherwin Williams paint colors in addition to a large spectrum of wood tones, glazes and brushed finishes.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/KC_NewLogo.webp" alt="KitchenCraft Cabinetry logo" width="654" height="129" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Kitchen Craft focuses on frameless construction because it provides seamless visual beauty while maximizing interior storage space. This means more space and full access to what you need when you need it.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2023/01/Man_RGB_Black.webp" alt="Mantra cabinetry logo" width="1200" height="172" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>The "quick ship" Mantra line offers quality, all-plywood construction with upgrades like dovetail &amp; soft close already built-in. </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2026/06/Northpoint.webp" alt="North Point Cabinetry logo" width="240" height="150" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text">North Point cabinets deliver high quality, all-wood construction with fast turnaround. Dovetail and pocket screw construction, a mix-and-match range of finishes and door styles, and in-stock availability with quick-ship delivery in approximately two weeks. Come see them in our showroom.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready to Choose Your Cabinets?</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Two showrooms. Two types of cabinetry. One team that's been doing this since 1928. Whether you're planning a full renovation or picking up cabinets for a project you're running yourself — come in and let's figure out what's right.</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Let&#x27;s Talk Kitchens</a></p></div><div class="el-col"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+15045394605">(504) 539-4605  |  singerkitchens.com</a></p></div></div></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
